== Overview ==
The '''Giant Dual-Blade Toilet''' is an enemy that can stun units in its way, this toilet is based on the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Giant_Dual_Blade_Skibidi_Toilet Giant Dual Blade Skibidi Toilet].

The Giant Dual-Blade Toilet has a lot of health and moves at medium speed, its debut is at wave 30 in [[Nightmare Mode]]. It also has a smaller version which is [[Dual Blade Toilet]]. The way it stuns units is by swinging its blade and stunning units nearby.

==Strategy ==
Towers that are stunned by the toilet can be revived by [[Medic Cameraman]] or [[Camera Repair Drone]], to defeat this enemy it is recommended to use units that do medium damage such as [[Laser Cameraman Car]] , [[Jetpack Cameraman]] or [[Titan Cameraman]]. 

This toilet can only stun close range so placing [[Units]] further from the track is ideal. 

